WEBVTT

01:31.040 --> 01:33.920
<b>Royal Colosseum</b>

01:34.080 --> 01:35.460
And his opponent...

01:34.380 --> 01:37.250
<b>#5 With His Grace!</b>

01:35.460 --> 01:38.420
Representing the Royal Order: Leo!

01:38.580 --> 01:39.580
<b>D-Block, Round 2</b>

01:45.880 --> 01:48.540
Whoa, that Leo dude is awesome...

01:48.540 --> 01:51.080
Compared to everyone else,
he's on a whole 'nother level...

01:51.290 --> 01:53.040
An easy victory.

01:54.210 --> 01:56.880
At this rate, you're bound to win.
Make us proud, Leo.

01:56.880 --> 01:59.210
You're the only one fit to be the Hero!

01:59.460 --> 02:00.380
Thanks.

02:09.630 --> 02:11.210
Lucky shot.

02:14.710 --> 02:17.210
Ooh... He's not half bad!

02:17.210 --> 02:19.920
Hey, I think this guy might
give you a run for your-

02:26.580 --> 02:27.500
Huh?

02:30.250 --> 02:31.540
Are you going out?

02:31.750 --> 02:35.000
Been cooped up lately.
I feel like gettin' some air.

02:37.130 --> 02:38.500
Whaddya want?

02:38.500 --> 02:39.880
I, um...

02:40.170 --> 02:42.420
...wanna tag along with you!

02:42.420 --> 02:43.750
Seriously...?

02:45.330 --> 02:46.830
Where are we going?

02:46.830 --> 02:49.630
Didn't plan on bein' out for very long, so...

02:49.630 --> 02:52.130
I ain't got anywhere specific in mind...

02:52.130 --> 02:54.250
Then let's go clothes shopping!

03:00.210 --> 03:02.130
<b>K.A. Boutique</b>

03:00.580 --> 03:02.500
What do you think of this one?

03:02.500 --> 03:03.880
Would it look good on me?

03:03.880 --> 03:04.880
Cute, right?

03:05.080 --> 03:06.830
Sure. Can we go now?

03:07.500 --> 03:09.130
Then again...

03:09.420 --> 03:13.040
I wish they had something
that's a little more my style...

03:13.380 --> 03:14.630
Oh, what about this?

03:14.630 --> 03:16.580
Yeah, it's great. Get that one.

03:16.580 --> 03:18.460
I'm just not sure...

03:18.460 --> 03:20.040
For Pete's sake...

03:20.580 --> 03:24.880
Hey, you, uh... ARE a guy, right?

03:28.710 --> 03:33.130
It doesn't... matter either way, does it?

03:35.380 --> 03:38.130
Shall I show you to the fitting rooms, Miss?

03:38.790 --> 03:41.330
Ah, thine offer humbles me! Lead the way.

03:41.330 --> 03:43.500
Don't talk to the employees like that!

03:44.790 --> 03:46.290
I almost forgot!

03:46.290 --> 03:48.750
We should buy some kids clothes, too.

03:49.000 --> 03:51.080
Oh, I see!

03:51.750 --> 03:52.420
How adorable!

03:52.420 --> 03:53.420
It's not like that!
How adorable!<b></b>

03:53.420 --> 03:54.920
We're not-

03:54.920 --> 03:57.210
Yer givin' her the wrong idea! Knock it off!

04:00.130 --> 04:01.630
Ugh, I'm exhausted...

04:01.630 --> 04:04.380
Don't be lazy! You're a hero, remember?

04:09.040 --> 04:10.500
Hang in there, Max!

04:10.500 --> 04:12.790
Once we finish up here,
we're done for the day.

04:13.040 --> 04:15.500
What do you want to eat?
I'll make anything you like!

04:15.500 --> 04:17.830
Hmm, lemme think...

04:18.750 --> 04:21.040
Sausage samples!

04:21.040 --> 04:22.460
They're finger-lickin' good!

04:24.880 --> 04:27.540
Crisp and juicy! We should buy some!

04:27.540 --> 04:29.830
Thank you very much!

04:29.830 --> 04:31.500
Wait a minute, aren't you...?

04:32.130 --> 04:34.000
You're Max, right?!

04:34.000 --> 04:36.170
Uh, yeah... That's me.

04:36.170 --> 04:36.830
How exciting!

04:36.830 --> 04:38.580
You got recognized again, Max.
How exciting!<b></b>

04:38.580 --> 04:39.250
You got recognized again, Max.
Running into you at a<b>
</b>grocery store, of all places...<b></b>

04:39.250 --> 04:40.380
Good job!
Running into you at a<b>
</b>grocery store, of all places...<b></b>

04:40.380 --> 04:41.460
Shut up!
Running into you at a<b>
</b>grocery store, of all places...<b></b>

04:41.460 --> 04:44.420
Are you his girlfriend?
You must be a model!

04:44.580 --> 04:46.670
Stop, you're too kind!

04:46.670 --> 04:50.420
Say, would you mind if I
shook your hand, Mr. Hero?

04:50.420 --> 04:53.790
Oh please, nobody's called me
a hero in a long time...

04:55.500 --> 04:59.210
Small world...
I didn't expect to see you again.

05:01.330 --> 05:03.540
I guess I'm just that lucky...

05:04.080 --> 05:05.210
You...!

05:06.580 --> 05:09.130
Now it makes sense why ya got man hands.

05:09.130 --> 05:13.130
You always were an expert
when it came to insulting women...

05:13.670 --> 05:15.500
I'm about to go on my break.

05:15.500 --> 05:17.920
Why don't we have a little chat out back?

05:18.210 --> 05:19.630
What happens if I say no?

05:21.080 --> 05:24.290
We wouldn't want to cause a scene,
would we? You understand.

05:24.290 --> 05:27.670
That is, if your girlfriend
doesn't mind waiting...

05:28.670 --> 05:29.750
Hey, Max...

05:29.750 --> 05:31.880
Just pretend to be a normal person.

05:31.880 --> 05:33.750
She and I need to have a discussion.

05:33.750 --> 05:35.250
Go on home without me.

05:35.250 --> 05:36.580
What's going on?

05:36.580 --> 05:38.630
Who the devil is this woman?

05:38.630 --> 05:40.580
<b>I'm a terrorist...</b>

05:38.630 --> 05:40.580
<b>Are you serious...?</b>

05:38.630 --> 05:40.580
<b>I can't stop crying over the truth about the Gamma Republic...</b>

05:39.170 --> 05:40.580
One of Leo's flunkies.

05:41.790 --> 05:45.790
And currently, a citizen of
the Gamma Republic... I assume.

05:46.670 --> 05:48.670
Hold on, Max!

05:48.670 --> 05:50.960
Who the heck is SHE?!

05:51.210 --> 05:53.920
Come back, ya jerk!

05:55.380 --> 05:58.000
She seems nicer than
your previous girlfriends.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.420
She's NOT my girlfriend.

05:59.420 --> 06:01.000
But is it a good idea?

06:01.000 --> 06:03.920
Looks to me like she's on the younger side...

06:04.210 --> 06:06.210
I should be askin' YOU that question.

06:06.210 --> 06:08.580
The hell are you doin' in a place like this?

06:08.580 --> 06:10.170
Oh, ya know...

06:10.170 --> 06:12.170
Spying on the enemy?

06:16.080 --> 06:17.920
One of Leo's people...

06:17.920 --> 06:19.330
Now I'm curious.

06:19.330 --> 06:21.830
Max told me to head home without him, but...

06:21.830 --> 06:24.250
Maybe I ought to go and keep an eye on him...

06:24.540 --> 06:28.000
Something tells me he might be
in some sort of trouble...

06:28.630 --> 06:33.250
D-dammit! He better not be doing
what I think he's doing...!

06:33.250 --> 06:34.710
I-I'll kick his ass!

06:34.710 --> 06:35.750
Pardon me.

06:36.830 --> 06:39.880
You're... Max's friend, right?

06:41.210 --> 06:42.580
Yes, that's right.

06:42.580 --> 06:44.880
I'll take ya out back to see him.

06:44.880 --> 06:46.670
Wouldja mind coming with me?

06:46.960 --> 06:49.500
I'm not saying you have to or anything...

06:49.500 --> 06:53.000
But if ya don't...
you might not ever see him again.

06:53.000 --> 06:56.330
Really?! You'll take me to him?! Thanks!

06:56.670 --> 06:58.080
Here, carry these.

07:01.500 --> 07:02.500
Here.

07:03.460 --> 07:05.130
How long's it been?

07:05.130 --> 07:06.830
Lemme think...

07:06.830 --> 07:10.580
We last saw each other about two years
before you guys defected,

07:10.580 --> 07:12.250
so at least five years, I reckon.

07:12.250 --> 07:15.000
Sounds about right.
You aged like milk, Max!

07:15.500 --> 07:17.630
I still look great, don't I?

07:17.630 --> 07:19.210
Kept up with my training.

07:19.210 --> 07:21.170
That's why I've got "man hands."

07:21.670 --> 07:24.130
And how's yer boss doin' these days?

07:24.130 --> 07:26.080
He's as full of energy as ever.

07:26.080 --> 07:27.880
I had a feeling you'd ask.

07:29.170 --> 07:32.670
Y'know, he's never stopped
thinking about you either.

07:32.670 --> 07:37.290
It's always, "I wonder how Max is doing..."
or "Whaddya think Max is up to?"

07:37.290 --> 07:39.290
Well, ya got yer answer to that one.

07:44.250 --> 07:47.290
So, you're from the Gamma Republic, right?

07:47.290 --> 07:48.380
I am.

07:48.380 --> 07:50.250
Which makes you a terrorist...

07:50.250 --> 07:51.210
Scary.

07:52.710 --> 07:56.710
We are NOT terrorists. Ya hear me?

07:56.710 --> 07:58.920
The Kingdom is in the wrong here.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.960
You're gonna smash the eggs...

08:00.960 --> 08:02.960
How do you think the boss felt

08:02.960 --> 08:06.290
when they forced him out into that
godforsaken wasteland?

08:06.290 --> 08:09.920
Do you have any idea how hard
we worked to make it liveable?!

08:10.170 --> 08:15.040
And as soon as those bastards
realized it had magic ore, they-

08:15.040 --> 08:18.420
I-I'm sorry! Please don't hurt me!

08:24.080 --> 08:26.500
So, you're here to try and recruit Max?

08:26.500 --> 08:28.670
To help you fight against the Kingdom?

08:28.670 --> 08:30.500
Sounds utterly ridiculous, doesn't it?

08:30.920 --> 08:33.630
Sure, he killed a demon lord or whatever.

08:33.630 --> 08:37.960
But how's one retired old geezer
joining our ranks supposed to help us?

08:37.960 --> 08:41.380
Then again, no one ever shuts up
about "Max this and Max that,"

08:41.380 --> 08:44.170
so I figured I might as well play along.

08:44.170 --> 08:45.960
In my own way, that is.

08:45.960 --> 08:47.210
Excuse me?!

08:47.210 --> 08:49.380
You arrogant jerk! You absolute moron!

08:49.380 --> 08:53.380
If you tried to fight Max, he'd crush
your skull in two seconds flat!

08:53.670 --> 08:55.630
I'd like to see him try.

08:56.250 --> 08:58.630
So Fred beat me to it...

08:58.630 --> 09:00.000
What'd you tell him?

09:00.000 --> 09:01.460
Turned him down.

09:01.460 --> 09:03.040
I don't wanna get involved.

09:03.040 --> 09:04.710
That's a relief...

09:04.710 --> 09:06.080
Oh yeah?

09:06.080 --> 09:09.080
Aren't YOU gonna try to drag me
into this mess, too?

09:09.080 --> 09:12.630
Hmm... Well, that's half the reason, I guess.

09:12.630 --> 09:14.500
There's something I want to give you.

09:17.460 --> 09:18.420
Ta-da!

09:17.460 --> 09:22.420
<b>Trachigo - Gamma Republic</b>

09:18.420 --> 09:20.630
Airship tickets to the Gamma Republic!

09:20.630 --> 09:22.420
With a layover in Trachigo.

09:22.540 --> 09:24.540
So long as they've got tickets,

09:24.540 --> 09:26.960
even residents of the Kingdom
can get in without any problems.

09:27.540 --> 09:29.460
Hah, what a crock of shit.

09:29.460 --> 09:30.670
Trachigo?

09:30.670 --> 09:32.920
Ain't they a buncha quacks, too?

09:32.920 --> 09:34.210
Well, yeah.

09:34.210 --> 09:37.170
But for us, they're an
important business partner.

09:37.170 --> 09:40.250
Doesn't mean I wouldn't mind
if you dropped by for a visit.

09:40.710 --> 09:42.630
If you're ever in the mood,
come hang out with us.

09:42.630 --> 09:44.880
I think it'd make the boss happy, too.

09:46.960 --> 09:49.210
Mm, I'll think it over.

09:50.540 --> 09:53.040
You're too soft, Big Sis.

09:53.330 --> 09:56.000
Giving him those tickets ain't gonna do shit.

09:56.000 --> 09:59.710
Ya finally found the Hero
and you're gonna let him get away?

09:59.710 --> 10:00.420
Will?!

10:00.420 --> 10:01.210
'Scuse me?

10:01.210 --> 10:04.040
Max! Save me!

10:04.040 --> 10:06.210
This guy's scaring me!

10:08.920 --> 10:10.580
The hell are you doing, Will?!

10:10.580 --> 10:12.710
Get your hands off her this instant!

10:12.710 --> 10:14.460
Help...!
Sometimes the situation calls for<b>
</b>drastic measures, Big Sis.<b></b>

10:14.460 --> 10:15.130
Sometimes the situation calls for
drastic measures, Big Sis.

10:15.130 --> 10:16.710
Oh no...!
Sometimes the situation calls for<b>
</b>drastic measures, Big Sis.<b></b>

10:16.710 --> 10:17.880
Ya think he's gonna come just 'cause
ya gave him a scrap of paper?

10:17.880 --> 10:20.290
Save me...!
Ya think he's gonna come just 'cause<b>
</b>ya gave him a scrap of paper?<b></b>

10:21.580 --> 10:25.000
See? Now he's got no choice
but to do as we say.

10:25.000 --> 10:26.710
Dammit, Will...

10:26.710 --> 10:28.750
Taking hostages for leverage?

10:28.750 --> 10:30.630
How's that NOT terrorist behavior?!

10:30.630 --> 10:32.920
Do you WANT to damage the boss' reputation?!

10:32.920 --> 10:35.330
She's right.
You should listen to yer big sis.

10:35.330 --> 10:36.920
Don't call me that!

10:37.170 --> 10:41.920
The Kingdom's spreading false information
about the Gamma Republic.

10:41.920 --> 10:43.920
It's all a bunch of twisted lies!

10:44.210 --> 10:47.080
So I'm extending an invitation
to you and your girlfriend.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.710
I think you'll like it.

10:48.710 --> 10:50.880
Much more than this shitty country.

10:51.670 --> 10:55.630
"Girlfriend"? Where's this so-called
girlfriend you speak of?

10:55.630 --> 10:57.330
'Cause I don't see her anywhere!

10:57.330 --> 10:58.420
Wha-?!

10:58.420 --> 11:01.710
Oh, real nice, Max! Don't you care
what happens to me?!

11:01.710 --> 11:03.710
Hurry up and rescue me, you idiot!

11:03.710 --> 11:05.380
You worthless freeloader!

11:05.380 --> 11:05.790
You stupid, lazy bum!
You don't even have a job!

11:05.790 --> 11:07.630
Are you mooching off her...?
You stupid, lazy bum!<b>
</b>You don't even have a job!<b></b>

11:07.630 --> 11:11.460
And here I'd hoped for a chance
to talk to the world-famous Hero...

11:11.460 --> 11:12.880
What a disappointment!

11:12.880 --> 11:16.380
He ain't got the guts to face me
even when his little girlfriend gets captured.

11:16.380 --> 11:19.080
If we bring him to the boss,
he's just gonna let us down.

11:19.080 --> 11:21.080
Knock it off already, Will!

11:21.080 --> 11:24.790
That's right. Ain't no point in havin'
this old geezer on yer side.

11:24.790 --> 11:26.670
So why're you wastin' my time?

11:26.670 --> 11:28.000
While that may be true,

11:28.000 --> 11:31.790
I can't just let you walk away
now that you know about the two of us.

11:31.790 --> 11:33.290
That makes zero sense.

11:33.290 --> 11:35.250
Yer the one pickin' a fight with me!

11:35.250 --> 11:38.380
I'm telling ya to shut up and
put your money where your mouth is!

11:38.380 --> 11:39.460
Or else-

11:45.500 --> 11:46.580
Ouch!

11:54.920 --> 11:56.790
This works out well, don'tcha think?

11:56.790 --> 11:59.540
If I defend myself,
they might discover my true identity...

11:59.540 --> 12:02.830
And that'd put you in
an even worse position, right?

12:02.830 --> 12:05.000
Don't get captured in the first place, dummy!

12:06.040 --> 12:07.380
Oh jeez...

12:09.790 --> 12:11.880
I'm so sorry about that, Max.

12:11.880 --> 12:14.460
He was still just a kid ten years ago.

12:14.460 --> 12:16.750
He doesn't know your reputation.

12:18.830 --> 12:22.750
We owe YOU an apology, too.
For scaring you.

12:22.880 --> 12:24.920
You ought to be ashamed!

12:24.920 --> 12:28.710
You'd have to live under a rock
to not know how cool Max is!

12:28.710 --> 12:29.630
Will?

12:29.630 --> 12:32.000
I was in the wrong...

12:32.000 --> 12:34.170
I apologize, Max.

12:35.040 --> 12:37.130
Learnin' from yer mistakes is important.

12:37.130 --> 12:39.130
Don't go causin' trouble for Leo.

12:39.130 --> 12:40.000
I won't...

12:40.000 --> 12:42.880
We should head back to the Gamma Republic.

12:42.880 --> 12:46.000
We had planned on leaving soon anyway.

12:46.000 --> 12:49.540
I might end up snitchin' on
the two of you to Fred.

12:50.250 --> 12:51.500
I figured.

12:51.500 --> 12:54.130
That's why we gotta high-tail it outta here.

12:55.500 --> 12:56.580
Take care of yourself.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.420
Thanks.

12:58.420 --> 12:59.830
Catch ya later!

13:03.080 --> 13:04.540
How rude...

13:04.540 --> 13:07.790
We finally go on a shopping trip,
and they just HAD to ruin it...

13:08.000 --> 13:10.000
Ugh, I'm beat...

13:10.380 --> 13:14.080
So... you're not going to take
the Gamma Republic's side?

13:14.080 --> 13:16.250
Not a chance. Leave me out of it.

13:16.670 --> 13:19.130
I don't mind tagging along, y'know.

13:19.130 --> 13:21.580
If you do end up deciding to
visit the Gamma Republic.

13:21.580 --> 13:25.670
You could overthrow the corrupt system
and found a brand-new nation alongside Leo!

13:25.670 --> 13:29.210
I mean, the whole thing
screams hero, so why not?

13:29.710 --> 13:33.210
'Cause then I'd have to fight Fred...

13:33.210 --> 13:34.380
Huh?

13:34.380 --> 13:37.210
Never mind. Let's just go home.

13:42.380 --> 13:43.960
How's your arm?

13:43.960 --> 13:46.000
We're almost there, okay?

13:46.000 --> 13:48.290
Okay... Sorry, Big Sis.

13:48.290 --> 13:49.630
Oh, it's the Seahorse!

13:49.960 --> 13:52.330
Hey there, Joe!

13:52.580 --> 13:55.250
Wassup, Anego?
It's been a minute!

13:55.250 --> 13:56.960
And Will, too!

13:56.960 --> 13:58.380
We're back!

13:58.380 --> 14:00.460
Is President Leo on board, by any chance?

14:00.460 --> 14:02.420
Nope, not at the moment.

14:02.420 --> 14:03.500
"At the moment"?

14:03.500 --> 14:04.830
Oh look, just in time.

14:10.540 --> 14:14.080
HELL YEAAAAAAAH!

14:20.880 --> 14:22.290
Hey, Boss!

14:22.710 --> 14:25.130
Flamboyant as always, I see...

14:25.130 --> 14:26.670
Welcome back, you two!

14:26.670 --> 14:29.540
Perfect timing! Let's have breakfast!

14:31.630 --> 14:33.290
<b>Trachigo - Gamma Republic</b>

14:33.420 --> 14:35.960
Are those the tickets that woman gave you?

14:35.960 --> 14:37.670
To the Gamma Republic?

14:38.000 --> 14:40.250
Is there a reason you're taking
pictures of them?

14:40.630 --> 14:43.420
'Cause ya can't get yer hands
on these in the Kingdom.

14:41.500 --> 14:44.630
<b>Airship Tickets</b>

14:41.500 --> 14:44.630
<b>Price High to Low</b>

14:41.500 --> 14:44.630
<b>Show Available Items Only</b>

14:41.500 --> 14:44.630
<b>Highly Rated</b>

14:41.500 --> 14:44.630
<b>Newest</b>

14:41.500 --> 14:44.630
<b>Recommended</b>

14:43.420 --> 14:45.580
Figured I might as well sell 'em online.

14:45.580 --> 14:46.830
Cheap bastard!

14:46.960 --> 14:48.080
What's the big deal?!

14:48.080 --> 14:51.040
She gave 'em to me,
so I can use 'em however I want!

14:51.040 --> 14:52.250
Seriously?

14:52.500 --> 14:56.210
It's a free trip to the Gamma Republic,
and you aren't going to go?

14:56.210 --> 14:57.500
Look...

14:57.500 --> 15:01.000
From an official standpoint,
it's a zone occupied by terrorists.

15:01.000 --> 15:03.380
It's WAY too risky for me to go!

15:03.380 --> 15:05.130
I'd never be able to come back.

15:05.130 --> 15:07.920
I feel like reselling tickets
to a place like that

15:07.920 --> 15:10.540
would be the riskier of the two options...

15:11.420 --> 15:12.540
That's it!

15:15.920 --> 15:17.420
Teleportal!

15:18.290 --> 15:19.460
Oooh...

15:19.460 --> 15:22.130
My powers are nearly back
to their full potential!

15:22.130 --> 15:25.580
I've put the return point for my
teleportation magic in this closet.

15:25.580 --> 15:29.290
That way, no matter what happens at our
destination, we can come back in a jiffy!

15:29.290 --> 15:32.210
Don't just spawn weird crap
in people's closets like that!

15:35.750 --> 15:37.080
You rang, milord?

15:37.080 --> 15:40.290
Pay attention, Zenia.
I shall be away for two days.

15:40.290 --> 15:42.130
While I'm gone, I need you to...

15:43.130 --> 15:44.880
Of course. Understood, milord.

15:44.880 --> 15:46.580
Leave it to me.

15:46.960 --> 15:49.170
I never agreed to go, y'know.

15:49.460 --> 15:52.130
Why don't you just go by yourself, Your Grace?

15:54.920 --> 15:56.210
Max...

15:56.540 --> 15:59.630
How come you won't take
MY feelings into consideration?

15:59.920 --> 16:03.460
Do you really hate going out in public
with me that much?

16:04.130 --> 16:06.420
No, it's just...

16:14.920 --> 16:17.540
Ah, so you're finally awake, eh, Max?

16:17.540 --> 16:19.250
There's nowhere to run now!

16:19.250 --> 16:21.750
Dammit, ya got me...

16:21.750 --> 16:23.130
You'd really go this far?

16:23.130 --> 16:24.920
The Max I knew ten years ago

16:24.920 --> 16:28.790
would've easily repelled an itty-bitty
enchantment spell like that one!

16:28.790 --> 16:31.290
If you take peace for granted,
you're going to get sloppy!

16:31.290 --> 16:33.040
I'll get you for this...

16:33.040 --> 16:34.580
Besides, Max...

16:34.580 --> 16:37.040
this is purely a reconnaissance mission.

16:37.420 --> 16:42.170
We must keep abreast of the situation in the
Gamma Republic, just to be on the safe side.

16:42.170 --> 16:44.290
This is NOT a vacation! Are we clear?

16:44.290 --> 16:47.130
Yer in an awfully good mood
for a not-vacation...

16:47.250 --> 16:49.380
Look at that, Max!

16:49.380 --> 16:51.710
We're flying above the big blue ocean!

16:52.170 --> 16:54.380
Airships sure are amazing, aren't they?

16:54.670 --> 16:58.580
<b>Trachigo International Airport</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:58.580
<b>Trachigo</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:58.580
<b>Gamma Republic</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:58.580
<b>Beskar Kingdom</b>

16:54.670 --> 16:58.580
<b>Sergendine</b>

16:58.710 --> 17:02.170
We will be arriving at the Trachigo
International Airport momentarily.

17:02.170 --> 17:04.880
All passengers on the deck,
please return to your-

17:05.250 --> 17:07.630
I know a lot of Leo's flunkies.

17:07.630 --> 17:09.330
Aside from the woman you met.

17:09.330 --> 17:10.960
It's gonna be a headache if they spot me.

17:10.960 --> 17:13.540
Don't worry! I've got just the thing.

17:13.540 --> 17:15.040
Put these on.

17:19.210 --> 17:21.380
Oh my god, they look perfect on you!

17:21.380 --> 17:22.710
How handsome!

17:22.710 --> 17:25.670
I oughtta put you to sleep
for another ten years!

17:25.750 --> 17:27.670
<b>Welcome to The Gamma Republic</b>

17:26.330 --> 17:27.670
Let's take a quick dip!

17:27.830 --> 17:30.170
Look! There's smoke in the air!

17:30.170 --> 17:32.170
Is there a battle going on...?!

17:32.170 --> 17:35.130
Nah... Looks like a completely
normal hot spring to me.

17:35.130 --> 17:39.130
Oh! So the city has a hot spring
flowing through it!

17:39.750 --> 17:44.080
My hometown had lava flowing
through it in certain places...

17:44.420 --> 17:45.710
This bring back memories!

17:45.710 --> 17:48.630
Hello, hello, hello! Excuse me? Hi there!

17:48.630 --> 17:51.630
Please, have a sample of our hot spring buns!

17:51.630 --> 17:54.960
Go ahead, help yourselves!
Have some! Don't be shy!

17:56.920 --> 17:57.920
They're delicious!

17:57.920 --> 18:01.290
Go on, have some more! Eat up!
We've got plenty to spare!

18:01.290 --> 18:02.920
And have some tea, too!

18:02.920 --> 18:03.750
Ouch-!

18:03.750 --> 18:04.790
Lady...!

18:08.130 --> 18:10.210
This place is great, don'tcha think?

18:10.210 --> 18:12.170
Where's this so-called terrorist country?

18:12.170 --> 18:16.580
Of course they're gonna do it up nice at
the front door for all the tourists to see...

18:16.880 --> 18:19.830
I guess they got enough money to afford it.

18:20.420 --> 18:25.040
So, does that mean you still think
the Gamma Republic is evil?

18:25.790 --> 18:27.920
Good and evil have nothin' to do with it.

18:27.920 --> 18:29.830
This place is a ticking time bomb.

18:29.830 --> 18:33.170
It's gonna cause problems,
regardless of the circumstances.

18:33.170 --> 18:35.880
As far as residents of the Kingdom
are concerned, it's a nuisance.

18:35.880 --> 18:36.920
End of story.

18:36.920 --> 18:40.380
Having a serious conversation with you
is even funnier when you're wearing those.

18:40.880 --> 18:42.580
And what about you?

18:42.580 --> 18:43.580
Me?

18:43.790 --> 18:48.580
Why's a demon like you pokin' his nose into
a stupid argument between humans?

18:48.580 --> 18:49.670
Well, I...

18:50.580 --> 18:52.170
You humans...

18:54.380 --> 18:57.670
If you humans get in a fight and
end up destroying each other,

18:57.670 --> 19:00.500
I see it as an absolute win!

19:00.500 --> 19:03.710
It'll be that much easier for my demonic
underlings to resume their invasion!

19:03.710 --> 19:07.290
And if you were to help Leo or Fred and
end up meeting your demise along with them,

19:07.290 --> 19:09.000
that'd be even better!

19:09.000 --> 19:11.670
Sorry for not livin' up to
your expectations, milord.

19:11.670 --> 19:13.210
Yo, look at 'em go!

19:13.460 --> 19:15.000
Is that President Leo?

19:16.170 --> 19:18.540
What? Did he just say Leo's here?

19:20.380 --> 19:23.080
What could he be doing
to draw such a big crowd...?

19:23.080 --> 19:26.000
Probably gracin' us with
a pompous speech or somethin'...

19:26.000 --> 19:27.540
Alright, here goes!

19:27.540 --> 19:29.790
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

19:30.000 --> 19:32.960
C'mon, boys! Keep at it!

19:32.960 --> 19:34.880
What's he doing with that thing...?

19:34.880 --> 19:36.250
Don't ask me!

19:36.250 --> 19:38.250
That's what we call "yumomi."

19:38.250 --> 19:39.080
You again?!

19:39.080 --> 19:42.000
The hot spring is far too hot
to bathe in right now.

19:42.130 --> 19:45.830
But if we were to add cold water, it would
dilute its natural mineral content, right?

19:45.830 --> 19:50.380
So we stir the water like this instead,
which cools it down to the perfect temperature!

19:50.500 --> 19:52.040
That makes sense...

19:52.040 --> 19:56.250
Yet this dude's down there
frolickin' in the pre-stirred water...

19:58.920 --> 20:02.580
And that's why he's the
Gamma Republic's fearless leader.

20:02.580 --> 20:04.170
Whoa, that's hot!
Just looks like he's dickin' around to me...<b></b>

20:04.170 --> 20:05.170
Just looks like he's dickin' around to me...

20:05.920 --> 20:08.420
Alright! That oughtta do it!

20:08.830 --> 20:11.210
Ladies and gentlemen! Thanks very much!

20:11.210 --> 20:13.250
Now go have some fun in the hot spring!

20:13.460 --> 20:16.210
He seems to be doing well!
That's good, huh?

20:17.290 --> 20:18.670
Yeah...

20:19.290 --> 20:21.210
He hasn't changed a bit...

20:21.790 --> 20:24.290
<b>Royal Colosseum</b>

20:24.460 --> 20:26.710
I wouldn't be surprised if
either one of them won!

20:26.710 --> 20:29.080
Yeah, things are bound to get heated...

20:43.580 --> 20:47.250
You understand, don't you?
The significance of this tournament.

20:47.250 --> 20:48.380
I do.

20:48.380 --> 20:52.130
Are you prepared to give your life
in the war against the demons?

20:52.130 --> 20:53.330
I am!

20:53.500 --> 20:54.500
Fight!

21:09.040 --> 21:10.580
Get him, Leo!

21:10.580 --> 21:13.210
Beat this amateur to a pulp!

21:29.790 --> 21:30.880
Leo...
